            "name": "Log conversation messages",
            "description": {
              "content": "Submit a batch of conversation message events to Botanalytics for analytics processing. The Node and Python SDKs wrap this endpoint. Requests are POSTed with a JSON body containing a `messages` array and a Bearer JWT whose `channel` claim identifies the source channel. The SDK retries failed POSTs (default limit 10) with a 30s request timeout.",
